  <ProfessionalSummary>覆盖主机冷却水系统管路穿舱水密安装和防火分隔合规性要求，包含焊接式水密套管、图纸送审、隔热及标识。</ProfessionalSummary>
  <EngineeringRequirements count="2">
    <Requirement id="ER-P048-01" level="1" requirementType="installation">
      <sysml:Name>管路穿舱水密安装</sysml:Name>
      <sysml:Text>系统管路穿过水密舱壁时，应采用焊接式水密套管，并确保水密完整性。</sysml:Text>
      <sysml:VerifiedBy method="inspection" />
      <sysml:DerivedFrom refId="ER-P048" />
      <sysml:Traceability>
        <Evidence id="E-IFACE-INST-001" supportStatus="supported_by_indirect_evidence" />
      </sysml:Traceability>
      <sysml:QualityStatus>
        <SupportStatus>supported_by_indirect_evidence</SupportStatus>
        <RiskIfUnmet>水密舱壁失效可能导致进水，影响船舶稳性和安全。</RiskIfUnmet>
        <ApplicabilityConstraint>本条需求基于 USCG 46 CFR 56.01-10 证据，适用范围限于该规则适用的项目，其他船级社应按其规范确认。</ApplicabilityConstraint>
      </sysml:QualityStatus>
      <sysml:AcceptanceCriteria>
        <Criterion>检查图纸确认水密套管采用焊接型式，且与舱壁的焊接满足船级社认可的标准。</Criterion>
        <Criterion>安装后按船级社规范进行水密试验，确认无泄漏。</Criterion>
      </sysml:AcceptanceCriteria>
      <sysml:EngineeringRationale>本条覆盖方面【管路穿舱水密安装】，来自原始需求「采用焊接式水密套管」。E-IFACE-INST-001 支撑了穿舱管路贯穿详图提交要求，间接支撑水密安装的图纸送审。</sysml:EngineeringRationale>
