    <Requirement id="ER-P048-02" level="1" requirementType="safety">
      <sysml:Name>防火分隔合规性</sysml:Name>
      <sysml:Text>管路穿舱安装应满足船级社防火分隔要求，高温冷却水管路应采取隔热措施，使表面温度不超过规定值，并设置安全标识。</sysml:Text>
      <sysml:VerifiedBy method="inspection" />
      <sysml:DerivedFrom refId="ER-P048" />
      <sysml:Traceability>
        <Evidence id="E-SUPP-SAFE-001" supportStatus="verified_by_direct_evidence" />
      </sysml:Traceability>
      <sysml:QualityStatus>
        <SupportStatus>verified_by_direct_evidence</SupportStatus>
        <RiskIfUnmet>高温表面可能引发火灾或人员烫伤，违反SOLAS防火要求。</RiskIfUnmet>
      </sysml:QualityStatus>
      <sysml:AcceptanceCriteria>
        <Criterion>高温冷却水管路（70–95°C）应绝热使表面温度低于55°C，绝热材料耐温不低于150°C并带铝皮护套。</Criterion>
        <Criterion>不能绝热的高温表面应贴ISO 11684热警示标识，间距不大于2m。</Criterion>
        <Criterion>管路按ISO 14726色标标识。</Criterion>
      </sysml:AcceptanceCriteria>
      <sysml:EngineeringRationale>本条覆盖方面【防火分隔合规性】，来自原始需求「满足船级社防火分隔要求」。E-SUPP-SAFE-001 直接支撑了高温冷却水管路隔热和标识要求。</sysml:EngineeringRationale>
